 156:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @param[out]  SectorError pointer to variable  that
 157:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *         contains the configuration information on faulty sector in case of error
 158:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *         (0xFFFFFFFFU means that all the sectors have been correctly erased)
 159:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *
 160:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @retval HAL Status
 161:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   */
